<title>USA: United Kingdom Fund Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>United Kingdom Fund Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.09		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net		 381			339</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.22		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net		 875			655</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 net realized and unrealized gains were $1.43 million ($0.36 per share) vs $4.17 million ($1.04 per share) in Q2 1995. Six months net realized and unrealized gains were $4.58 million ($1.14 per share) vs $5.87 million ($1.47 per share) in first six months 1995.</p>
<p>Period ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
